== WHAT TO DO
Declare the callee first, or qualify it with the module that declares it
(`call json_lex::json_escape then body`, after `import json_lex`).

@example reject
import std::dfa

dfa d over ascii:
    start:
        'a' -> call e then accept

dfa e over ascii:
    start:
        'a' -> accept

0
@caption e is declared after d
@error CORE SEMANTIC DFA-UNKNOWN-DFA
@at 5:21
@end

@topic error.dfa-recursive-call
